# Silverpine Forest (Alliance) - Completionist (pack butler-routes-completionist, v1).
# Alliance addendum to the Horde route: the 5 Alliance-acceptable Silverpine
# accepts the Horde census set aside (docs/silverpine-census.md, Alliance
# addendum section; contract silverpine-forest-alliance, order 34). The
# set-aside list named 94501 for the Dwarf/Gnome Shaman link, but the data
# shows 94501 accepting in the Wetlands (already wetlands.guide's) - the
# Silverpine link is 94505, contracted here in its place, argued in the
# census. Levels 20-33 by the data (trio min24/lvl33; 94505 min20/lvl23;
# 8993 min1/lvl60 Winter Veil event, an anytime pickup while it runs).
# An Alliance expedition into Horde territory: entry follows the Hillsbrad
# guide through 92432 (its turnin IS the Modera image), field work crosses
# into Alterac (remnant kills, the mote, Celindra's turn-in) and closes in
# Loch Modan (Norric's turn-in). No loop steps: every placed complete rides
# data-placed coordinates; unplaced objectives ride bag notes, never
# invented points.
guide butler-routes-completionist/silverpine-forest-alliance
title Silverpine Forest (Alliance) - Completionist
levels 20-33
zone Silverpine Forest
faction Alliance
category Leveling
folder Completionist
coords live
version 1

step Modera's Image - the Kirin Tor trio

  zone map 1421

  note In from the Hillsbrad border: the Hillsbrad guide's 92432 (Emissary Jacques) turns in at the Image of Archmage Modera (68.62,45.18) - this addendum picks up there.
  accept 92457 -- Starving Arcane - the Image; remnants west in Alterac (needs 92432 Hillsbrad first - take its warning if it is not done)
  accept 92458 -- Heart of Disruption - the Image; the mote drops in Alterac (needs 92432 Hillsbrad first)

step East woods - Kwee's gift

  zone map 1421

  note East to the Peddlefeet camp (74,13) for the Winter Veil pickup (seasonal - Kwee only trades during the feast).
  accept 8993 -- Gift Giving - Kwee Q. Peddlefeet; the collection has no placed source in the data (check bags; the route never waits on it)
  complete 8993
  note 8993's Alliance Gift Collection has no placed source in the data - have it in your bags.
  turnin 8993 -- Gift Giving - the collection to Kwee Q. Peddlefeet (74,13)

step West woods - the water manifestation

  zone map 1421

  note West to the manifestation (38.65,44.58) for the Dwarf/Gnome Shaman link.
  accept 94505 only Shaman -- Call of Water - the Manifestation; Dwarf/Gnome link (races=68); Norric in Loch Modan takes it (needs 94503 Westfall object first - take its warning if it is not done)

step Alterac expedition - remnants and motes

  zone map 1416

  note Over the east border into west Alterac for the trio's field work; the frame switches on.
  complete 92457 @14.2,68.4 -- Saturated Remnants (west Alterac)
  complete 92457 @14.3,67.5 -- Mana Echoes (west Alterac)
  note 92457's Seeking Remnants have no placed spawn in the data - check bags; the route never waits on them.
  collect 251961 @15,55.4 -- Arcane Mote (Shade of the Archmage, Heart of Disruption)
  note Rath'mael (the mote's other named dropper) has no placed spawn in the data - work the Shades above.
  tip Expedition leg to Alterac; the frame switches on.

  zone map 1421

step Modera's Image return - turn-ins

  zone map 1421

  note Back to the Image (68.62,45.18) with the Alterac work done.
  turnin 92457 -- Starving Arcane - the remnants' word to the Image (68.62,45.18)
  turnin 92458 -- Heart of Disruption - the mote to the Image (68.62,45.18)
  accept 92459 -- Friend of the Kirin Tor - the Image; Celindra in Alterac takes it (needs 92458 above first)

step Alterac return - Celindra

  zone map 1416

  note Back over the border to Celindra (14.15,60.05) with 92459; the frame switches on.
  turnin 92459 -- Friend of the Kirin Tor - the Image's word to Archmage Celindra (14.15,60.05)
  tip Expedition leg to Alterac; the frame switches on.

  zone map 1421

step Loch Modan - Norric's word

  zone map 1432

  note South to Loch Modan to close the water link; the frame switches on.
  turnin 94505 only Shaman -- Call of Water - the Manifestation's word to Norric Lochthane (41.76,19.05)
  tip Expedition leg to Loch Modan; Norric holds the Shaman water line onward. The addendum ends here.
